    "description": "Redis Sentinel health from the native OpenTelemetry redis receiver (redis.sentinel.* metrics parsed from the Sentinel INFO command) plus the tcpcheck receiver for reachability. Per-master detail (master status, quorum, ok-sentinels/ok-slaves, known sentinels) requires the SENTINEL masters command, which the receiver does not issue, so those panels are not present.",
